# Route Handlers

## Layers

```
route (thin) → metrics/mapper → opendental snapshot | ghl client
```

- Business logic in `src/lib/metrics/` and mappers — not in Route Handlers
- Money as integer cents in metrics lib when deriving CPL / ROI / production
- Never import Open Dental/GHL clients into Client Components

## API behavior

- Explicit loading/error mapping via HTTP status codes and clear JSON errors
- Unauthorized / validation / not-found / upstream failure handled distinctly
- On upstream failure for read dashboards: prefer mock fallback with `{ source: "mock" }` rather than a blank page

## Secrets

- Read only from `process.env`; never return tokens or API keys in responses
